     rreeccuurrssiioonn ttoooo ddeeeepp  for too many levels of nested execution.

     The recursion level is increased by one if the _x or _? operation or one of
     the compare operations resulting in the execution of register is exe‐
     cuted.  As an exception, the recursion level is not increased if the op‐
     eration is executed as the last command of a string.  For example, the
     commands

           [lax]sa
           1 lax

     will execute an endless loop, while the commands

           [laxp]sa
           1 lax

     will terminate because of a too deep recursion level.

